{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859530/extras/c9eee3aff9a10df60e98906e64f0859f.poster.avif?t=1771099019\" width=630 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859530/extras/c9eee3aff9a10df60e98906e64f0859f.webm?t=1771099019\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859530/extras/c9eee3aff9a10df60e98906e64f0859f.mp4?t=1771099019\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this roguelike platformer, you play as the sandmouse to descend into a maze-like dungeon. Test your map-sense and mark your way through each level to find the optimal paths. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859530/extras/d5c80068692269dcf15db80bcda88479.poster.avif?t=1771099019\" width=630 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859530/extras/d5c80068692269dcf15db80bcda88479.webm?t=1771099019\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859530/extras/d5c80068692269dcf15db80bcda88479.mp4?t=1771099019\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each day, you'll need to loot the dungeon and find your way back to the shop before night falls. There, you can purchase various upgrades to push further on the following days within the same run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859530/extras/f2534c7f723638d87138bd3ffd34cc22.apng?t=1771099019\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859530/extras/f2534c7f723638d87138bd3ffd34cc22.poster.avif?t=1771099019\" class=\"bb_img\" width=631 height=172 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Besides enemies and traps, you'll have to race against time. Plan your route and rush through the dungeon to make it out before time's up!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859530/extras/02afd19adec94326a0d0abf96398f716.poster.avif?t=1771099019\" width=631 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859530/extras/02afd19adec94326a0d0abf96398f716.webm?t=1771099019\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expansive procedurally-generated levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place sunflags to mark the way</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced, challenging gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge modifiers for adjusting game difficulty and level size</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mid-run shop with upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multi-day runs\u20148 tries to beat each  dungeon</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Day/night sequence</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short, 20\u201330 minute runs</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trailer Music by Major Bruno</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"A start","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2859530/b03de9960f4541a58cc5f3745043d0d80df61054.jpg"},{"name":"Treasure hunter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2859530/78a0a0b15256717b51bb0bab87b7